@startuml 02-controlled-pr-change
title Domain Story 2 — Sales Controlled Purchase Request Change
hide footbox
autonumber
actor Sales
actor "B2B Buyer" as Buyer
participant "Purchase Request" as PR
participant "Sales Commitment" as SalesCommitment
participant "Inventory Availability" as Inventory
participant "Credit & Receivables" as Credit

Sales -> PR : Review submitted request
Sales -> PR : Propose controlled commercial change
opt material content requires business consent
  PR -> Buyer : Preserve consent-required evidence
  Buyer --> PR : Accepted commercial decision
end
alt confirm
  PR -> SalesCommitment : Convert without release/re-reserve gap
  SalesCommitment -> Inventory : Atomically replace/adjust protection
  SalesCommitment -> Credit : Atomically replace/adjust applicable reservation
  SalesCommitment --> PR : Sales Order confirmed
else reject
  PR --> Buyer : Rejection with reason
else unresolved or Buyer withdraws
  PR --> Buyer : Preserve request history
end

note over PR,SalesCommitment
Buyer cannot freely mutate a submitted PR.
Product substitution needs explicit Buyer acceptance.
end note
@enduml
